      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 68-year-old woman reported acute severe pain in both lower limbs during a dipyridamole sestamibi myocardial perfusion scan. The pain was rapidly relieved by the administration of intravenous aminophylline. A review of the literature on the adverse effects of dipyridamole did not include this symptom."},
